close_comment = "The wallet workspace lockfile now includes the SDK's jsdom and react-dom dependencies and matches the current manifest. Both development dependencies are retained, frozen-lockfile checks remain enabled, and regression coverage asserts that the wallet workspace installs with its committed lockfile."
